  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.0.0 establishes the stable 1.x contract across net8.0/net9.0/net10.0 with the same frozen public API and enum layout qualified by 1.0.0-rc1. Breaking change from the final 0.x line: public TerminalSession.Input is removed so a live session retains one authoritative input/query-routing path; ITerminalInput remains public for custom transport injection. Stable 1.0 adds no new terminal protocol family beyond rc1; it promotes the documented architecture, ownership, lifecycle, query, restoration, security, compatibility, and package contracts to stable support. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.0.0/docs/releases/1.0.0.md ; migration: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.0.0/docs/Migration-to-1.0.md",
